<title>USA: Georgia to sell $307 mln GO bonds on April 8.</title>
<headline>Georgia to sell $307 mln GO bonds on April 8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia plans to sell $307.195 million of general obligation bonds in a competitive sale set for April 8, market sources said Monday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
